"P982761270" "Toggle: Adds a Chance for Fear to most damaging powers.  This ability gives a 45% chance for its effects to occur on each hit.  Also adds a chance for +1 magnitude to all of your status effects while active.  Equipping this Hybrid power grants a passive boost to Status Resistance at all times."

