// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1850302929" "Toggle: Chance for Fear, Chance for Immobilize, Chance for Stun (Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3612795408" "Toggle: Adds a Chance for Fear  and a Chance for Immobilize to most damaging powers.  This ability gives a 70% chance for its effects to occur on each hit.  If your target is already Immobilized and Feared, you have an additional 100% chance to stun that target.  Equipping this Hybrid power grants a passive boost to Status Resistance at all times."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Melee Genome 1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1215673252" "Melee Genome"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2824309476" "Toggle: Self +Regen"
// Power Help Text :
"P4149226597" "This power grants the user a stacking Regeneration buff for each enemy within an 8 foot radius.  The effect reaches its maximum strength at 4 enemies.  This power also grants some Regeneration with no enemies in range.  Equipping this Hybrid power grants a passive boost to Regeneration at all times."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Melee Genome 2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P293915334" "Melee Core Genome"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3234617812" "Toggle: Self +Regen,+Res(All) per nearby enemy"
// Power Help Text :
"P1372974329" "This power grants the user a stacking Regeneration and Resistance buff for each enemy within an 8 foot radius.  The effect reaches its maximum strength at 4 enemies.  This power also grants a small amount of Regeneration and Resistance even with no foes in range.  Equipping this Hybrid power grants a passive boost to Regeneration at all times."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Melee Genome 3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2557202330" "Melee Radial Genome"
