"P1405182648" "Toggle: Self +Regen, +Def(All) per nearby enemy"
// Power Help Text :
"P3791319372" "This power grants the user a stacking Regeneration and Defense buff for each enemy within an 8 foot radius.  The effect reaches its maximum strength at 4 enemies - these enemies will be taunted by this power.  Equipping this Hybrid power grants a passive boost to Regeneration at all times."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
