// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Slash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2699670818" "Frigid Slash"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P193225107" "Melee, Moderate DMG (Cold/Negative Energy), -RES(Foe, Cold/Negative Energy)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2719835512" "You slash your target with icy claws, cursing them with the pain of death. As the pain courses through the body, it causes cold and negative energy damage. Additionally, the target's defense against cold and negative energy attacks is reduced."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2352506031" "-RES (Cold/Negative Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P808509691" "Your resistance against cold and negative energy attacks has been reduced!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3100069073" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you, causing {Damage} points of cold damage and reducing your resistance to cold and negative energy."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P940855137" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} weakens your soul, causing {Damage} points of negative energy damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Slice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2592705142" "Frigid Slice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P983430508" "Melee (Cone), Moderate DMG (Cold/Negative Energy), -RES(Foe, Cold/Negative Energy), Fear(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3074575698" "You jump in the air, slashing at your target repeatedly with icy claws as you fall to the ground. As the death energy courses through the body, it causes cold and negative energy damage. Additionally, the target's defense against cold and negative energy attacks is reduced. This attack has a chance to terrify your target."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1689499586" "-RES (Cold/Negative Energy), Chance to Fear"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3116337263" "Your resistance against cold and negative energy attacks has been reduced. Additionally, you may suffer from a spell of fear."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P722686188" "You cower in fear after {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3659092579" "Frigid Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2308046063" "Targeted AoE (Secondary Targeted), Superior DMG(Cold/Negative Energy), -DEF(Foe, All), -Regen(Foe), -Rec(Foe), Chance for EndDrain(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2481176831" "You fire a mass of coalesced death energy at a single target. This mass explodes on reaching its destination, causing the target and those nearby to suffer its ill effects. In addition to cold and negative energy damage, the affected targets have reduced defense, regeneration and recovery. There is also a chance that your target will suffer from endurance drain."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P4166605419" "-DEF(All), -Regen, -Rec, Chance for EndDrain"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3830474687" "Your defense, regeneration and recovery are reduced. You may also be suffering from endurance drain."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P247185040" "You are caught in the eruption of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} and suffer {Damage} points of cold damage, as well as reduced defense, regeneration and recovery."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2563062418" "The death energy unleashed by {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} also drains your soul, causing {Damage} points of negative energy damage."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Lore_Pet_Banished_Boss 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2854530223" "Lore_Pet_Banished_Boss"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Smash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P372381645" "Frigid Slam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P12576286" "PBAoE, Moderate DMG (Cold), Minor DoT(Negative Energy), -RES(Foe, Cold & Negative Energy), Chance for +EndCost(Foe), Knockback(Foe), Chance for +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2744993419" "You slam the ground with both of your fists, unleashing a small shockwave of death energy around you. This causes cold damage and negative energy damage over time on all opponents around you. Additionally, the affected targets will suffer reduced resistance to cold and negative energy attacks. Finally, the longer you remain in combat, the more likely you will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1462250670" "DoT(Negative Energy), -RES (Cold/Negative Energy), Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2718529971" "You are suffering negative energy damage over time. Your resistance against cold and negative energy attacks has been reduced, and you may suffer increased endurance costs."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P797178642" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you off your feet with its {PowerName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Beam 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P4047903928" "Frigid Beam"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1084281461" "Ranged (Cone), Superior DMG(Cold), Moderate DoT(Negative Energy), -RES(Foe, All), -End(Foe), Chance for +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1982856162" "You focus death energy into both of your fists before unleashing a deadly beam at a target. The affected target and all those within a cone between you suffer cold damage and negative energy damage over time. Additionally, all affected targets lose endurance and have lowered resistance to all damage. Finally, the longer you remain in combat, the more likely you will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2864902434" "DoT(Negative Energy), -RES(All), -End, Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1167642373" "You are suffering negative energy damage over time and are losing endurance. Additionally, your resistance to all forms of damage has been reduced. You may suffer increased endurance costs."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2863899955" "{PlayerSource} freezes you in a {PowerName}, causing {Damage} points of cold damage, reducing your resistance and draining your endurance."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Blast 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3915929439" "Frigid Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2111990690" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Cold), Minor DoT(Negative Energy), -ToHit(Foe), -Rech(Foe), -Speed(Foe, All), Chance for +EndCost(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2149455381" "You fire a blast of death energy at a single opponent. This bolt causes cold damage and negative energy damage over time. Additionally, it lowers your chance to hit and both movement and combat speeds. Finally, the longer you remain in combat, the more likely you will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P522125907" "DoT(Negative Energy), -ToHit, -Rech, -Speed(All), Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1627301359" "You are suffering negative energy damage over time and are losing endurance. Additionally, your chance to hit, movement speed and combat speed are all lowered. You may suffer increased endurance costs."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3374605627" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you, causing {Damage} points of cold damage. Your movement and combat speeds have been reduced, along with your chance to hit."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Frigid Enervation 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P259686197" "Frigid Enervation"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P407259589" "Targeted AoE (Secondary Target), High DMG(Cold), Moderate DMG(Negative Energy), +EndCost(Foe), -Regen(Foe), -Rec(Foe)"
// Power Help Text :
"P846082397" "You envelop your target in death energy, causing cold damage and negative energy damage over time. The density of the energy overwhelms the target's body, lowering regeneration and recovery while also increasing the endurance cost of powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1629103652" "+EndCost, -Regen, -Recovery"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1018526452" "Your regeneration and recovery have been reduced and powers cost more endurance to use."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2033049651" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you, causing {Damage} points of cold damage. Your regeneration and recovery are reduced and the endurance cost of your powers has increased."

