"P1080845918" "Empowering Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P85652084" "Targeted AoE, +Regen, +Rec, +End, +Recharge"
// Power Help Text :
"P1324411488" "You fire a mass of coalesced life energy at a single target. This mass explodes on reaching its destination, causing the target and those nearby to be infused with its power. All affected targets have enhanced Regeneration, Recovery, Recharge and steadily gain Endurance over Time."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P268880227" "You are caught in the eruption of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName}. Your Recovery, Regeneration, and Recharge Rate are boosted, and you gain endurance each second."

