"P3854521401" "Ranged (Cone), High DMG(Lethal), Moderate DoT (Lethal), Chance for -Speed(All), -Recharge on Foes"
// Power Help Text :
"P2337193523" "You slice your blades through the air with such power that a shockwave is generated. This shockwave travels quite some distance, cutting down those in its path. Enemies struck by the shockwave suffer lethal damage and bleeding wounds. Additionally, there is a chance they will be knocked back and winded, which reduces their recharge time and speed briefly."
