// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2185398307" "The bleeding wounds suffered from {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} cause an additional {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4061376226" "The force of {PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} knocks you back and leaves you winded, reducing your movement speed and attack speed."

