// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Seasonal Shift 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P207916876" "Seasonal Shift"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3298464186" "PBAoE, Moderate DoT (Fire or Cold), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P294705294" "You rapidly draw in an immense amount of energy from the outer reaches of a 30' radius around you, igniting it in a fiery burst. The region within 15' of you burns, causing fire damage and reduction in chance to hit on enemy targets, while the region between 15' and 30' of you freezes, causing cold damage and reducing enemy targets' movement and attack speeds."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2060357551" "DoT(Fire or Cold), Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3788711341" "You are affected by a seasonal shift around a Diviner. Depending on your distance from the Diviner when this attack is used, you will suffer either fire damage over time and a reduction in your chance to hit or cold damage and reduced movement and attack speeds."
