// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1237802494" "Self, +Res(All but Psionics), +DEF(All but Psionics), -SPD, -Recharge, -DMG"
// Power Help Text :
"P2054627562" "When you activate this power, you are transformed into a massive bulk of unyielding Granite. Your incredible mass makes you almost completely invulnerable and resistant to most effects.  However, you also become quite heavy, cannot fly, your attack and movement speed are Slowed and you do less damage. Granite Armor also grants you high resistance to Defense DeBuffs.Cannot be active at the same time as other Armors in this set, Fly powers, Sprint, Super Speed, or Jump powers. Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2575653961" "Your Granite Armor has made you practically invulnerable!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Earth's Embrace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P265760604" "Earth's Embrace"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2993602068" "Self +HP, Res(Toxic)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1712881187" "You are so connected to the Earth, you can draw upon its power to add to your own health. Activating this power increases your maximum Hit Points, and grants you resistance to Toxic Damage. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1325981346" "Your {PowerName} has increased your maximum Hit Points."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Mud Pots 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P832014938" "Mud Pots"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2362314667" "Toggle: PBAoE, Minor DoT(Fire), Foe Immobilize, -SPD"
// Power Help Text :
"P2201496496" "While this power is active, you draw upon the geothermal power of the Earth to create a bubbling pool of hot mud around yourself. All foes in melee range will become snared and entrapped in the mud, Immobilizing some and slowing others. The boiling heat from Mud Pots also deals some damage over time to the snared foes. Damage: Minor(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3184577122" "Your {PowerName} Slow all nearby foes."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1503949059" "DoT(Fire), Immobilize, -SPD"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2574801233" "The Mud Pots are burning you and reducing your Running speed.  You may be immobilized, as well."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3992812993" "{PowerName} deal {Damage} points of fire damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P227651641" "The Mud Pots around {PlayerSource} scalds you for {Damage} points of fire damage and slows you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Quicksand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2550309372" "Quicksand"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2544749673" "-Speed, -Jump, -Fly, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P339426154" "Your Running speed, Jump height and Defense are reduced by the Quicksand."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Stone Prison 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1247417221" "Stone Prison"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P153652083" "Ranged, Moderate DoT(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -DEF, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P2944472620" "Immobilizes a single target within an earthy formation and deals some Smashing damage over time. Some more resilient foes may require multiple attacks to Immobilize. Stone Prison can also reduce a target's Defense. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1935306243" "DoT(Smashing), Immobilize, -Fly, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3639973498" "You are being crushed by a Stone Prison.  You are immobile and cannot fly.  Your Defenses are reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2648729445" "Your {PowerName} crushes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduce his Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2911945440" "{PlayerSource} crushes you with his {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fossilize 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1486930030" "Fossilize"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2785664101" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Hold, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P831309527" "Encases a single target within solid stone. The stone slowly crushes the victim, dealing Smashing damage. The Fossilized victim is held helpless and unable to defend himself. Damage, Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2471844614" "Hold, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2688767313" "You have been Fossilized and are held.  Your Defenses are reduced."

