"P1625010446" "Melee Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Minor Disorient"
// Power Help Text :
"P1095291228" "Your stone covered fists attack swiftly for moderate damage, and may Disorient your opponent. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2658325911" "Your {PowerName} smashes {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
