"P3767210672" "This massive attack hits with all the force of the Earth itself. It deals tremendous amounts of damage, and may Hold the target if they are not defeated outright. Damage: Extreme, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
